00:00:38.441 --> 00:00:39.547
BEEN HOSPITALIZED,

00:00:39.548 --> 00:00:43.245
WHAT DOES THAT TELL YOU ABOUT

00:00:43.246 --> 00:00:44.935
HIS CASE, HIS CONDITION?

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:46.806
&gt;&gt; Dr. Inglesby: WELL, CHRIS,

00:00:46.807 --> 00:00:48.515
I THINK THE NEWS THAT WE HEARD

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:49.443
YESTERDAY WAS LARGELY

00:00:49.478 --> 00:00:51.331
ENCOURAGING, THE FACT THAT THE

00:00:51.365 --> 00:00:52.868
PRESIDENT IS NOT REQUIRING

00:00:52.902 --> 00:00:54.129
OXYGEN, THAT A NUMBER OF LAB

00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:55.845
CHECKED ON MY TESTS WERE

00:00:55.847 --> 00:01:00.333
REPORTED TO BE NORMAL AND HE WAS

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:01.500
ABLE TO DELIVERED

00:01:01.502 --> 00:01:01.748
YESTERDAY.

00:01:01.782 --> 00:01:03.356
WHAT WE HEARD FROM THE FROM THE

00:01:03.357 --> 00:01:04.918
CHIEF OF STAFF WAS CONCERNING,

00:01:04.953 --> 00:01:06.116
THE FACT THAT AT LEAST

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.588
MR. MEADOWS SAID HIS VITAL SIGNS

00:01:07.622 --> 00:01:09.194
WERE CONCERNING ON FRIDAY, THAT

00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:11.157
HE WAS REQUIRING OXYGEN.

00:01:11.158 --> 00:01:12.713
THOSE ARE WORRISOME THINGS.

00:01:12.748 --> 00:01:14.376
IF AT LEAST THEY SUGGEST FOR THE

00:01:14.377 --> 00:01:16.264
PRESIDENT DOES HAVE PULMONARY

00:01:16.265 --> 00:01:17.585
INVOLVEMENT FROM COVID IF THOSE

00:01:17.586 --> 00:01:18.621
THINGS ARE CORRECT, AND THERE

00:01:18.622 --> 00:01:20.991
WERE A NUMBER OF TESTS THAT I

00:01:21.025 --> 00:01:23.120
PRESUME WERE DONE AT WALTER

00:01:23.154 --> 00:01:25.883
REED, INCLUDING A CHEST X-RAY,

00:01:25.884 --> 00:01:28.238
CT SCAN, WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT,

00:01:28.239 --> 00:01:29.475
INFLAMMATORY MARKERS, IT WOULD

00:01:29.476 --> 00:01:31.120
BE USEFUL TO BE ABLE TO JUDGE

00:01:31.121 --> 00:01:32.458
HIS RISK GOING FORWARD TO KNOW

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:33.838
WHAT THE RESULTS OF THOSE TESTS

00:01:33.872 --> 00:01:35.595
WORK, BUT SO FAR THE NEWS THAT

00:01:35.629 --> 00:01:37.972
WE’VE HEARD HAS BEEN

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:38.470
ENCOURAGING.

00:01:38.472 --> 00:01:40.222
&gt;&gt; Chris: THAT’S ENCOURAGING

00:01:40.256 --> 00:01:41.107
TO HEAR.

00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:42.925
BUT YOU ANTICIPATED WHERE I WANT

00:01:42.926 --> 00:01:44.736
TO TAKE THIS.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.184
THE PRESIDENT IS A 74-YEAR-OLD

00:01:47.219 --> 00:01:49.076
MAN WHO IS TECHNICALLY OBESE.

00:01:49.078 --> 00:01:52.920
HOW LONG BEFORE WE HAVE A SENSE

00:01:52.955 --> 00:01:54.493
WHETHER HE’S OUT OF THE WOODS,

00:01:54.528 --> 00:01:55.562
AND IN WHAT ONE POINT

00:01:55.563 --> 00:01:57.899
MARK MEADOWS WAS SAYING THE NEXT

00:01:57.933 --> 00:01:59.043
48 HOURS, THE DOCTORS WERE

00:01:59.045 --> 00:02:00.149
SAYING 7-10 DAYS.

00:02:00.183 --> 00:02:01.698
WHEN ARE WE GOING TO KNOW

00:02:01.699 --> 00:02:02.755
WHETHER HE’S OKAY AND I GUESS

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.575
PART OF THE QUESTION IS, WHAT IS

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.100
THE LIKELIHOOD, BEING WHERE HE

00:02:06.101 --> 00:02:08.039
IS RIGHT NOW THAT HE CAN

00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:10.546
PARTICIPATE IN A PRESIDENTIAL

00:02:10.547 --> 00:02:12.063
DEBATE IN 11 DAYS?

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:14.444
&gt;&gt; Dr. Inglesby: IT IS ALWAYS

00:02:14.478 --> 00:02:16.058
VERY DIFFICULT TO MAKE JUDGMENTS

00:02:16.093 --> 00:02:17.585
ABOUT INDIVIDUALS, ESPECIALLY --

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:18.775
UNLESS YOU’RE REALLY INVOLVED IN

00:02:18.776 --> 00:02:19.527
THE CARE.

00:02:19.561 --> 00:02:21.694
OVERALL IN THIS AGE CATEGORY,

00:02:21.728 --> 00:02:24.602
PEOPLE THE PRESIDENT’S AGE, IT

00:02:24.603 --> 00:02:26.631
WAS A STUDY DONE BY CDC IN

00:02:26.665 --> 00:02:29.550
JANUARY TO MAY TIME FRAME THAT

00:02:29.584 --> 00:02:31.821
SET A THIRD OF PEOPLE HIS AGE

00:02:31.822 --> 00:02:32.954
WERE DIAGNOSED WITH COVID WOULD

00:02:32.955 --> 00:02:33.843
BE HOSPITALIZED AND THAT THERE

00:02:33.845 --> 00:02:37.260
IS A SIGNIFICANT MORTALITY RATE

00:02:37.261 --> 00:02:38.560
IN THAT AGE GROUP.

00:02:38.594 --> 00:02:39.442
THE PRESIDENT IS RECEIVING

00:02:39.477 --> 00:02:40.935
EXTRAORDINARY CARE AND IT LOOKS

00:02:40.969 --> 00:02:42.673
LIKE IS DOING WELL BUT IT’S

00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:45.286
CERTAINLY A SERIOUS DISEASE FOR

00:02:45.288 --> 00:02:47.128
PEOPLE OF HIS AGE AND WITH

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:47.764
UNDERLYING CONDITION.

00:02:47.799 --> 00:02:50.817
WE DO KNOW THAT SOME PEOPLE HAVE

00:02:50.851 --> 00:02:52.119
SYMPTOMS THAT ARE MILD AND

00:02:52.154 --> 00:02:53.661
RECOVER AND DO EXTRAORDINARILY

00:02:53.695 --> 00:02:55.794
WELL IN THE FIRST WEEK BUT THERE

00:02:55.796 --> 00:03:00.033
ARE OTHERS THAT IN THE 5-10 DAY

00:03:00.034 --> 00:03:01.913
TIME RANGE CAN HAVE A RELATIVELY

00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:03.541
QUICK DETERIORATION AND DEVELOP

00:03:03.543 --> 00:03:04.256
MORE SEVERE SYMPTOMS.

00:03:04.258 --> 00:03:06.613
IT’S VERY DIFFICULT TO JUDGE

00:03:06.614 --> 00:03:07.797
THAT AT THIS TIME.

00:03:07.832 --> 00:03:09.332
AGAIN, THOSE ADDITIONAL TEST

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:10.669
RESULTS WOULD HELP US MAKE SOME

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.252
JUDGMENT ABOUT THE LIKELIHOOD OF

00:03:12.287 --> 00:03:13.974
HIS DISEASE GETTING BETTER OR

00:03:13.975 --> 00:03:15.854
THE POTENTIAL FOR WORSENING.

00:03:15.888 --> 00:03:17.484
IN TERMS OF THE DEBATE, I THINK

00:03:17.518 --> 00:03:19.779
IT’S TOO SOON TO SAY.

00:03:19.781 --> 00:03:21.099
GO AHEAD, CHRIS.

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:22.746
&gt;&gt; Chris: IS GOING TO ASK YOU

00:03:22.747 --> 00:03:25.699
THOUGH, BECAUSE THIS DOES GET TO

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.389
THE BIGGER ISSUE OF THE PROPER

00:03:27.423 --> 00:03:28.450
SAFETY REGULATIONS.

00:03:28.452 --> 00:03:30.759
THE RALLIES THAT THE PRESIDENT

00:03:30.794 --> 00:03:33.078
HELD WHERE THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:35.388
WHERE THERE, OFTEN TIMES WITH NO

00:03:35.389 --> 00:03:37.875
SEPARATION, THE VAST MAJORITY OF

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:41.840
THEM NOT WEARING MASKS AND THEN

00:03:41.841 --> 00:03:44.473
AS I DISCUSSED WITH STEVE

00:03:44.508 --> 00:03:45.632
CORTES, THE PRESIDENT’S FAMILY

00:03:45.633 --> 00:03:47.148
AND ADVISORS IGNORING THE

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.872
REQUIREMENT AT THE DEBATE THAT

00:03:49.906 --> 00:03:51.033
THEY WEAR MASKS.

00:03:51.034 --> 00:03:54.057
AS A PUBLIC HEALTH OFFICIAL,

00:03:54.091 --> 00:03:56.023
WHAT DO YOU THINK OF THAT?

00:03:56.056 --> 00:03:58.168
&gt;&gt; Dr. Inglesby: YEAH, I THINK

00:03:58.202 --> 00:04:00.537
THERE IS CLEAR DANGER IN HAVING

00:04:00.538 --> 00:04:02.509
EVENTS WHERE THERE ARE MANY

00:04:02.544 --> 00:04:04.016
PEOPLE CLOSE TOGETHER WITHOUT

00:04:04.051 --> 00:04:05.413
WEARING MASKS FOR A LONG PERIOD

00:04:05.414 --> 00:04:07.261
OF TIME, ESPECIALLY WHERE LOUD

00:04:07.263 --> 00:04:08.608
VOICES ARE USED.

00:04:08.643 --> 00:04:10.656
WE KNOW VIRUS IS SPREAD BY LOUD

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.402
VOICE MORE EFFECTIVELY SO I

00:04:12.404 --> 00:04:13.794
REALLY THINK LARGE GATHERINGS

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:14.654
LIKE RALLIES SHOULDN’T BE

00:04:14.689 --> 00:04:16.610
HAPPENING AT THIS POINT FOR ANY

00:04:16.612 --> 00:04:17.829
PURPOSE DURING A PANDEMIC, WHICH

00:04:17.864 --> 00:04:20.012
IS, IN THE LAST FEW WEEKS,

00:04:20.014 --> 00:04:21.947
ACTUALLY BEEN GETTING WORSE.

00:04:21.949 --> 00:04:23.787
AND I THINK WHEN THE COMMISSION

00:04:23.788 --> 00:04:24.984
SETS RULES FOR PREVENTING

00:04:24.986 --> 00:04:26.502
TRANSMISSION DURING DEBATES,

00:04:26.536 --> 00:04:27.939
THEY SHOULD BE FOLLOWED.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.094
PEOPLE SHOULDN’T BE MAKING THEIR

00:04:29.129 --> 00:04:30.458
OWN DECISIONS, THEY SHOULD BE

00:04:30.492 --> 00:04:31.402
FOLLOWING THE RULES THAT ARE

00:04:31.436 --> 00:04:33.229
ESTABLISHED BY THE PUBLIC HEALTH

00:04:33.264 --> 00:04:34.515
EXPERTS WHO SET UP THOSE

00:04:34.516 --> 00:04:34.687
DEBATES.

00:04:34.722 --> 00:04:38.004
&gt;&gt; Chris: I WANT TO PICK UP ON

00:04:38.039 --> 00:04:39.553
A QUESTION I ASKED MR. STEVE

00:04:39.587 --> 00:04:40.080
CORTES.

00:04:40.082 --> 00:04:41.493
AND THAT’S THE CONTINUITY OF

00:04:41.495 --> 00:04:43.253
GOVERNMENT, BECAUSE THE

00:04:43.254 --> 00:04:44.983
PRESIDENT IS IN THE HOSPITAL.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:47.422
AS WE SAY, HIS PROGNOSIS IS

00:04:47.456 --> 00:04:50.786
UNCERTAIN IN THE COURSE OF THIS.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:51.700
YOUR THOUGHTS ABOUT

00:04:51.734 --> 00:04:53.406
VICE PRESIDENT PENCE, THE NEXT

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.060
IN LINE TO THE PRESIDENCY, GOING

00:04:56.094 --> 00:04:58.423
AHEAD WITH PUBLIC RALLIES, GOING

00:04:58.424 --> 00:04:59.383
AHEAD WITH THIS DEBATE.

00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:01.725
IS THAT A SENSIBLE ACTION FOR

00:05:01.726 --> 00:05:03.369
HIM TO TAKE, OR DOES IT RAISE

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.306
CONCERNS ON YOUR PART ABOUT THE

00:05:05.307 --> 00:05:07.399
NEXT PERSON IN LINE TO THE

00:05:07.434 --> 00:05:07.752
PRESIDENCY?

00:05:07.786 --> 00:05:10.044
&gt;&gt; Dr. Inglesby: MY VIEW AT

00:05:10.078 --> 00:05:11.749
THIS POINT IS THAT THE REST OF

00:05:11.783 --> 00:05:12.531
THE DEBATES, THE

00:05:12.565 --> 00:05:14.617
VICE PRESIDENTIAL DEBATE AND IF

00:05:14.651 --> 00:05:16.922
THERE ARE PRESIDENTIAL DEBATES

00:05:16.957 --> 00:05:17.691
SHOULD BE VIRTUAL.

00:05:17.692 --> 00:05:19.790
I THINK AT THIS POINT WE’VE SEEN

00:05:19.791 --> 00:05:22.066
FROM THE FIRST DEBATE THAT THERE

00:05:22.101 --> 00:05:23.080
WERE UNANTICIPATED VERY LARGE

00:05:23.081 --> 00:05:26.024
RISKS THAT DEVELOPED AROUND THE

00:05:26.026 --> 00:05:27.683
DEBATE AND DAYS AFTERWARDS AND

00:05:27.717 --> 00:05:29.860
IN FACT, BY PUBLIC ACCOUNTS, IT

00:05:29.894 --> 00:05:31.573
LOOKS LIKE THE VICE PRESIDENT

00:05:31.608 --> 00:05:32.882
HAD A MEETING WITH THE PRESIDENT

00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:35.965
ON TUESDAY, PERIOD OF TIME WHERE

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.660
HE WOULD BE PRESUMED TO BE

00:05:37.661 --> 00:05:38.753
CONTAGIOUS AND IN MY MIND IT

00:05:38.754 --> 00:05:40.435
SEEMS LIKE THE VICE PRESIDENT

00:05:40.469 --> 00:05:42.117
SHOULD BE IN QUARANTINE, EVEN IF

00:05:42.118 --> 00:05:43.437
HE IS GETTING TESTED ON A DAILY

00:05:43.471 --> 00:05:45.489
BASIS AND SO IN ANY EVENT I

00:05:45.491 --> 00:05:48.403
DON’T THINK IT IS A PROPER RISK

00:05:48.438 --> 00:05:51.744
TO TAKE TO HAVE HIM GATHERING

00:05:51.746 --> 00:05:53.794
WITH SENATOR HARRIS IN PERSON

00:05:53.795 --> 00:05:56.216
AND IT COULD EASILY DO THIS

00:05:56.217 --> 00:05:57.853
DEBATE VIRTUALLY AS WAS DONE IN

00:05:57.888 --> 00:05:59.026
THE PAST FOUR AT LEAST IN THE

00:05:59.028 --> 00:06:00.941
CASE OF KENNEDY AND NIXON, I

00:06:00.975 --> 00:06:02.191
KNOW WE DID VIRTUAL DEBATES BUT

00:06:02.193 --> 00:06:03.726
FOR PUBLIC HEALTH PURPOSES I

00:06:03.728 --> 00:06:06.141
THINK IT WOULD BE SAFER TO HAVE

00:06:06.142 --> 00:06:08.306
THESE LARGE GATHERINGS AT THIS

00:06:08.308 --> 00:06:09.811
POINT GIVEN THE RISKS OF THE

00:06:09.846 --> 00:06:10.030
PANDEMIC.

00:06:10.064 --> 00:06:12.257
&gt;&gt; Chris: I WANT TO PICK UP ON

00:06:12.258 --> 00:06:13.779
SOMETHING YOU JUST SAID, WHICH

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.171
IS THAT IN FACT THE PANDEMIC IS

00:06:16.172 --> 00:06:18.343
GETTING WORSE.

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:21.577
THE PRESIDENT HAS BEEN SENDING A

00:06:21.611 --> 00:06:23.182
CONSISTENTLY OPTIMISTIC MESSAGE

00:06:23.183 --> 00:06:26.435
ABOUT WHERE WE ARE WITH COVID-19

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:27.266
IN RECENT DAYS.

00:06:27.267 --> 00:06:29.723
HERE’S SOME CLIPS FROM THAT,

00:06:29.724 --> 00:06:30.694
TAKE A LOOK.

00:06:30.729 --> 00:06:32.923
&gt;&gt; WE ARE ROUNDING THE TURN, WE

00:06:32.924 --> 00:06:34.992
ARE ROUNDING THE CORNER OF THE

00:06:34.993 --> 00:06:35.261
PANDEMIC.

00:06:35.296 --> 00:06:36.047
TREMENDOUS PROGRESS IS BEING

00:06:36.081 --> 00:06:37.881
MADE AND I SAY IT AND I’LL SAY

00:06:37.882 --> 00:06:38.920
IT ALL THE TIME, WE ARE ROUNDING

00:06:38.921 --> 00:06:39.726
THE CORNER.

00:06:39.727 --> 00:06:43.031
I JUST WANT TO SAY THAT THE END

00:06:43.065 --> 00:06:45.372
OF THE PANDEMIC IS INSIGHT.

00:06:45.373 --> 00:06:48.318
&gt;&gt; Chris: DOCTOR, WHERE ARE WE

00:06:48.353 --> 00:06:50.220
REALLY WITH COVID-19 AT THIS

00:06:50.255 --> 00:06:51.055
POINT IN THIS COUNTRY?

00:06:51.056 --> 00:06:52.496
&gt;&gt; Dr. Inglesby: WE ARE STILL

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.438
IN THE MIDDLE OF A DANGEROUS

00:06:54.472 --> 00:06:55.495
PANDEMIC IN THIS COUNTRY.

00:06:55.529 --> 00:06:57.730
IF YOU LOOK AT THE PAPERS THIS

00:06:57.765 --> 00:06:59.659
MORNING AND THE DATA, YOU CAN

00:06:59.694 --> 00:07:01.003
SEE THAT SOMETHING ON THE ORDER

00:07:01.004 --> 00:07:03.044
OF TWO-THIRDS OF THE STATES IN

00:07:03.045 --> 00:07:05.627
THE COUNTRY HAVE HAD INCREASES

00:07:05.662 --> 00:07:07.672
IN COVID NUMBERS IN THE LAST

00:07:07.707 --> 00:07:11.010
WEEK AND WE ARE SEEING, AS YOU

00:07:11.045 --> 00:07:12.561
SAID EARLIER, IN THE 40,000

00:07:12.596 --> 00:07:13.649
RANGE OF CASES EVERY DAY.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:14.837
HOSPITALIZATION RATE HAS JUST

00:07:14.872 --> 00:07:16.964
BEGUN TO TAKE UP AGAIN IF YOU

00:07:16.998 --> 00:07:18.594
LOOK AT THE NUMBERS ACROSS THE

00:07:18.629 --> 00:07:19.664
COUNTRY, AND THERE ARE PLACES IN

00:07:19.666 --> 00:07:21.413
THE COUNTRY IN THE MIDWEST,

00:07:21.414 --> 00:07:22.383
PARTICULARLY IN WISCONSIN, WHICH

00:07:22.417 --> 00:07:25.457
ARE HAVING EXTRAORDINARY

00:07:25.491 --> 00:07:27.763
NUMBERS, BY HIGHEST NUMBERS YET.

00:07:27.797 --> 00:07:29.522
PLACES IN WISCONSIN HAVING

00:07:29.556 --> 00:07:31.106
TROUBLE ACCOMMODATING ALL OF THE

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.451
SICK PEOPLE THAT ARE COMING SICK

00:07:32.485 --> 00:07:34.456
WITH COVID, SO I THINK PEOPLE

00:07:34.491 --> 00:07:37.058
NEED TO REALLY CONTINUE TO TAKE

00:07:37.059 --> 00:07:39.372
THIS VERY SERIOUSLY TO AVOID

00:07:39.373 --> 00:07:40.763
LARGE GATHERINGS, WHERE MASKS,

00:07:40.764 --> 00:07:42.855
PHYSICALLY DISTANCE AS THEY HAVE

00:07:42.856 --> 00:07:44.080
BEEN OVERTIME AND HOPEFULLY IN

00:07:44.115 --> 00:07:46.026
THE MONTHS AHEAD WE WILL BEGIN

00:07:46.027 --> 00:07:47.167
TO GET VACCINES COMING ONLINE,

00:07:47.169 --> 00:07:48.415
BUT IN THE MEANTIME IT’S

00:07:48.417 --> 00:07:49.624
IMPORTANT TO TAKE ALL THE

00:07:49.658 --> 00:07:51.225
PRECAUTIONS WE’VE BEEN TAKING

00:07:51.226 --> 00:07:52.545
ALL ALONG TO PREVENT

00:07:52.546 --> 00:07:52.919
TRANSMISSION.

00:07:52.921 --> 00:07:54.255
&gt;&gt; Chris: I’VE GOT ABOUT A

00:07:54.256 --> 00:07:55.707
MINUTE LEFT AND YOU’VE ANSWERED

00:07:55.742 --> 00:07:58.618
PART OF IT, BUT WHAT IS THE

00:07:58.619 --> 00:07:59.513
BIGGEST LESSON THAT PEOPLE

00:07:59.547 --> 00:08:00.609
SHOULD TAKE ON THE FACT THAT

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:02.053
EVEN THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:08:02.055 --> 00:08:03.395
UNITED STATES, WHO WAS IN THE

00:08:03.396 --> 00:08:05.038
MOST SECURE HEALTH BUBBLE OF

00:08:05.039 --> 00:08:06.383
ANYBODY MAYBE IN THE WORLD CAN

00:08:06.418 --> 00:08:08.590
STILL GET THIS, WHAT’S THE

00:08:08.624 --> 00:08:10.093
LESSON PEOPLE SHOULD TAKE FROM

00:08:10.094 --> 00:08:13.135
THAT AND SPECIFICALLY WHAT THEY

00:08:13.169 --> 00:08:14.353
SHOULD AND SHOULDN’T DO?

00:08:14.354 --> 00:08:15.878
&gt;&gt; Dr. Inglesby: I THINK THE

00:08:15.879 --> 00:08:17.006
LESSON IS THAT THIS IS STILL THE

00:08:17.008 --> 00:08:18.172
SAME VIRUS.

00:08:18.206 --> 00:08:19.257
THE VIRUS HASN’T CHANGED.

00:08:19.291 --> 00:08:20.993
WE HEARD EARLIER THIS WEEK THAT

00:08:21.028 --> 00:08:22.895
